WEBVTT

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:12.506
Choose Categories in the side menu.

00:00:16.972 --> 00:00:22.972
Click Add category.

00:00:25.613 --> 00:00:31.613
Type "Demo Study Skills" in the Name box.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:42.800
Click Save.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:51.440
Click Move Demo Study Skills up.

00:00:55.541 --> 00:01:01.541
Click Rename Demo Study Skills.

00:01:05.523 --> 00:01:11.523
Type "Demo Study Skills
Tips" in the Name box.

00:01:17.313 --> 00:01:23.313
Click Save.

00:01:25.953 --> 00:01:31.953
Click Hide Demo Study Skills Tips.

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:42.296
Click Delete Demo Study Skills Tips.

00:01:46.882 --> 00:01:52.882
Click Delete category.
